  "_meta": {
    "description": "Exact-match registry of Harbor artifact.repository values -> owning stack + network zone, for harbor_findings_sync.py's in_production/stack classification. Built 2026-09-01 from the real distinct artifact.repository values seen live in harbor-findings (terms aggregation, not guessed) cross-referenced against terraform/lxc/stacks/*/ + each stack's real network_zone. Exact match only, deliberately not substring/prefix matching -- a substring like 'community/' would silently misclassify netboxcommunity/netbox as greenbone-stack. An unmatched repository defaults to in_production:false/stack:null (unknown), never guessed -- add it here explicitly once confirmed, per docs/threat-vuln-platform/plan.md's UVM redesign phase.",
    "operator_decisions_2026-09-01": [
      "vulhub/* and vxcontrol/* are EXPLICITLY non-production regardless of whether they'd otherwise match a deployed stack (vxcontrol/* is PentAGI, genuinely deployed via pentagi-stack, but PentAGI is declared defunct -- operator chose to exclude it from the production view anyway).",
      "elastic/* has no entry: the legacy elastic-stack LXC (vmid 112) that produced these Harbor scans was decommissioned 2026-09-01 -- stale historical data, correctly falls through to the unknown/false default."
    ]
  },
